//Papers on Desk
"Steel_Cube_Papers" "<face heading><span align=center><font color=red>Cool Space Show Fan Club</font></span></face><br><br>I never write fan letters, but I wanted to let you guys know how much I love your show!  I watch every week and I totally love your rounded paper edges.  I heard there is a story behind that!<br><br>So, hey, can you tell me how to get in touch with that really cute actor who plays the Captain?  He's so cute.  I totally adore him.<br><br>Can I get a picture?  That would be so cool!  Autographed would be nice!<br><br>Sincerely,<br><br>Annie<br><br><span align=center>From the desk of Ann E. Wills<br>'Your number one fan'</span>"

